  m_Text: "In Daddict, you step into the shoes of a daring runner on a wild trip
    through a colorful, chaotic world. The more you move, the more intense things
    get. Collect points, dodge obstacles, and try not to lose your mind!\nMaster
    the simple controls \u2014 press Space to jump, S to slide \u2014 and see how
    far you can go. But beware\u2026 the deeper the run, the weirder it gets.\n\n"
